cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LISFLOOD-FP × SWMM bidirectional coupling"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the upstream LISFLOOD-FP and SWMM works."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Ruiyi
    affiliation: FloodGroup
  - name: FloodGroup
license: GPL-2.0-only
abstract: >
  Two-way coupling of the GPU 2-D flood model LISFLOOD-FP (8.1.0, commit
  637106b; CUDA ACC and FV1 solvers) with the 1-D sewer model EPA SWMM 5.1.015
  in a single executable. Manholes exchange water through orifice and weir laws
  in both directions, a new COUPLED outfall type discharges into finite-volume
  2-D receiving cells, and SWMM node flooding is returned to the surface.
keywords:
  - flood
  - LISFLOOD-FP
  - SWMM
  - coupling
  - urban drainage
  - GPU
